.TH oxiarc-detect 1  "oxiarc-detect 0.3.6" 
.SH NAME
oxiarc\-detect \- Detect archive format
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBoxiarc\-detect\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] <\fIFILE\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Detect archive format
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.TP
<\fIFILE\fR>
File to detect (use "\-" for stdin)
.SH VERSION
v0.3.6
